<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Yasuo Rapid Triple Tornado </Major>
    <Description>Description
This macro script complements the "Delayed Tornado Macro" for Yasuo in "League of Legends." It facilitates the execution of a rapid triple tornado sequence by automating the required combo after activating the delayed tornado.

Features
Seamless Combo Integration: Designed to be used within two seconds after the delayed tornado combo, enabling a swift transition to the rapid triple tornado.
Cursor-Based Targeting: The macro executes the combo at the cursor's location, ensuring precise engagement with enemies.
Automated Combo Execution: Activates the E-Q and a delayed right-click combo automatically to initiate the rapid triple tornado.
How to Use
Initial Setup: Successfully execute the delayed tornado using the first macro.
Targeting: Move your mouse cursor over the desired target.
Activation: Press the designated macro key within two seconds of the delayed tornado attack to execute the rapid triple tornado combo.
Requirements
A PC with "League of Legends" installed and running.
The first macro for the delayed tornado must be executed correctly prior to using this macro.
Disclaimer
Using macros can violate the Terms of Service for "League of Legends" and may lead to account sanctions. Utilize this macro at your own discretion.
The developer of this macro is not liable for any consequences that arise from using this script, including but not limited to account suspension or bans.
</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 8 1
Delay 10 ms
KeyUp 8 1
Delay 100 ms
KeyDown 20 1
Delay 10 ms
KeyUp 20 1
Delay 440 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 10 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 64
GoWhile 9 10</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>League of legends</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>